<div class="sg-legal-page__grid">
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'contact' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Contattare l'Utente</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Mailing list o newsletter e Modulo di contatto</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> città; cognome; email; nome; numero di telefono; professione</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'tags' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Gestione dei tag</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Google Tag Manager</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Strumenti di Tracciamento</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'hosting' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Hosting e infrastruttura backend</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">SiteGround Hosting</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Dati di utilizzo; Strumenti di Tracciamento; varie tipologie di Dati secondo quanto specificato dall'informativa privacy del servizio</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'social' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Interazione con social network e piattaforme esterne</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Pulsante Mi Piace e widget sociali di Facebook, Pulsante Pin it di Pinterest</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Dati di utilizzo</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'stats' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Statistica</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Google Analytics (Universal Analytics)</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Dati di utilizzo; Strumenti di Tracciamento</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'optimize' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Test di performance di contenuti e funzionalità (A/B testing)</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Google Optimize 360</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Dati di utilizzo; Strumenti di Tracciamento; varie tipologie di Dati secondo quanto specificato dall'informativa privacy del servizio</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sg-legal-page__card">
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-icon-wrap">{% render 'sg-legal-icon', icon: 'external' %}</div>
    <div class="sg-legal-page__card-body">
      <h3 class="sg-legal-page__card-title">Visualizzazione di contenuti da piattaforme esterne</h3>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-services">Google Fonts, Vimeo video, Widget Instagram</p>
      <p class="sg-legal-page__card-data"><span class="sg-legal-page__card-data-label">{{ personal_data_label }}</span> Dati di utilizzo</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
